                <pb facs="0930" n="824" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg824"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Kensett Champney &amp; Co. to Minister
                    Combs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Senahú</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic">May 5,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Besides the colonists that they have already taken away from us for the work on
                    the Northern Railroad, they continue demanding others.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kensett Champney</hi> &amp; Co.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
